<item><title>Madagascar launches $250 million electricity programme tied to results</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-launches-250-million-electricity-programme-tied-f7112b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-launches-250-million-electricity-programme-tied-f7112b/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The ASCENT programme, funded by the World Bank, aims to bring better power access and modern cooking to more than 2.5 million people by 2030.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 05:53:46 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-launches-250-million-electricity-programme-tied-f7112b/share.jpg" length="42694" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-launches-250-million-electricity-programme-tied-f7112b/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
